  "what_this_answers": "Whether a learned generative patient model degrades the T(D) equality from exact to approximate, as paper/wmhs/sections/full/refdesign.tex predicts. It does not: T(D~) and theta_hat(D~) are both functionals of the SAME synthetic cohort, so whether they coincide is a property of the estimator's functional form and the generator's learnedness never enters. Approximate equality does appear, but from a solver's convergence constant or a regularisation constant -- numerical decisions, not statistical ones."
